    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You create a noxious cloud similar to&nbsp;fog cloud&nbsp;that is harmful to living creatures.&nbsp;Smog bank&nbsp;obscures sight just as&nbsp;fog cloud&nbsp;does. Living creatures without @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.rules.Item.WP7hddXW4mLXXXOg]{Environmental protections} that are in the area when the spell is cast or who enter the area must attempt a Fortitude save or be sickened for as long as they remain in the cloud and for 1d4+1 rounds thereafter.</p>"
